    "description": "Official PLK 'Otwarte Dane Kolejowe' API (pdp-api.plk-sa.pl) — the infrastructure manager's authoritative planned schedule. For every view-map row PKP operates (agency_id or bot_agency_id), PLK outranks the Polish GTFS bundle and Back-on-Track for station lists, times and calendar; Nightjet-covered trains are left untouched. Station names are resolved onto the map's stop table (PLK has no coordinates); GTFS/OSM geometry is kept. Also folds the same stop lists into pkpTrainShapes.json. Gated on /data-version so a typical night is a single request. Requires the PLK_API_KEY secret (absent key is a safe no-op).",
